{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JOLlanTGpxe3hCcMz3GH8w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:00.622543+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/JOLlanTGpxe3hCcMz3GH8w","html":"<div><section><section><p><span><span>北京师范大学法学院2027年法律硕士（法学/非法学）专业学位研究生推荐免试综合考核采取现场考核方式。</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>一</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KAmVU9FEmibzAviaPJYV90DGNX6xgXFWfNiaibfTDy9PTzz1aZfGricNxCibib6DpwyD7tK3rWxcKya4Kfjw8lvQgVRYkEAw7LiafSPvYCIv2r0InT0/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>招生学科专业</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>详见我校2027年硕士研究生招生专业目录。实际录取人数将视最终计划分配和综合考核情况动态调整。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>二</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KAmVU9FEmibzAviaPJYV90DGNX6xgXFWfNiaibfTDy9PTzz1aZfGricNxCibib6DpwyD7tK3rWxcKya4Kfjw8lvQgVRYkEAw7LiafSPvYCIv2r0InT0/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>报名</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）报考专业要求</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>（1）申请参加法律硕士（非法学）专业学位研究生推免的人员，申请前所学专业须为非法学专业（普通高等学校本科专业目录法学门类中的法学类专业[代码为0301]毕业生不得申请）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）申请参加法律硕士（法学）专业学位研究生推免的人员，申请前所学专业须为法学专业（仅普通高等学校本科专业目录法学门类中的法学类专业[代码为0301]毕业生）。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（二）报名流程</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>报名流程详见北京师范大学研究生招生网公布的《北京师范大学2027年推荐免试硕士/博士研究生招生录取工作办法》。</span></span></p><p><span><span>所有申请人登录我校推免申请系统，上传提交电子版材料如下：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）《北京师范大学2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生申请表》。此表由申请人在“推免申请系统”中填写信息后打印，打印前须按要求上传本人电子照片，确认无误后本人签字。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）外国语水平证明，如国家英语四、六级、TOEFL、雅思等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（3）各类获奖证书和发表的学术论文。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（4）成绩单。（须加盖学校教务部门或院系公章）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（5）个人自述。（请按模板出具）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（6）诚信承诺书。（请按模板出具）</span></span></p><p><span><span>（7）申请人认为有必要提交的可以证明自己综合素质、学术潜力的其他材料。</span></span></p><p><span><span>第（5）（6）项材料，申请人在北京师范大学研究生招生网公布的《北京师范大学2027年推荐免试硕士/博士研究生招生录取工作办法》附件中下载。</span></span></p><p><span><span>第（4）（5）项材料上传至我校推免申请系统－上传材料对应位置；除第（4）（5）项外的其他材料电子版请打包上传至我校推免申请系统－上传材料－其他材料中。</span></span></p><p><span><span>所有材料纸质版在综合考核报到时提交我院审核备案，提交的材料恕不退还。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（三）报名截止时间</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>报名截止时间：北京时间9月10日10:00。</span></span></p><p><span><span>所有申请人须在报名截止时间之前在我校推免申请系统上传规定的材料，下载并填写相关表格。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>三</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KAmVU9FEmibzAviaPJYV90DGNX6xgXFWfNiaibfTDy9PTzz1aZfGricNxCibib6DpwyD7tK3rWxcKya4Kfjw8lvQgVRYkEAw7LiafSPvYCIv2r0InT0/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>考核流程</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）材料审核</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>我院对申请人材料进行审核，择优确定入围后续环节综合考核名单。</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院只接收第一志愿申请。</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（二）后续环节综合考核</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>1.报到及资格审核</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院将在综合考核前组织实施资格审核，申请人应配合完成。未参加资格审核或资格审核不通过的申请人，我院不予安排综合考核。</span></span></p><p><span><span>报到时间：9月18日、19日</span></span></p><p><span><span>报到地点：请关注法学院官网后续通知</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.综合考核时间地点</span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>层次</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业代码及名称</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>综合考核时间</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>综合考核地点</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>硕士</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>035101 法律（非法学）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9月19日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>报到时通知</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>硕士</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>035102 法律（法学）</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>9月20日</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>报到时通知</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><span><span>3.综合考核形式为现场面试，面试考核内容包括外语、综合素质测试、思想政治素质和品德考核。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.综合考核成绩=面试成绩。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>四</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KAmVU9FEmibzAviaPJYV90DGNX6xgXFWfNiaibfTDy9PTzz1aZfGricNxCibib6DpwyD7tK3rWxcKya4Kfjw8lvQgVRYkEAw7LiafSPvYCIv2r0InT0/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>录取</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>按照综合考核成绩并结合当年推免招生计划，择优确定拟录取名单，报学校审核批准。</span></span></p><p><span><span>思想政治素质和品德考核不合格者不予录取。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>五</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KAmVU9FEmibzAviaPJYV90DGNX6xgXFWfNiaibfTDy9PTzz1aZfGricNxCibib6DpwyD7tK3rWxcKya4Kfjw8lvQgVRYkEAw7LiafSPvYCIv2r0InT0/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>其他</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>1.接收为硕士的申请人，须在我院规定时间内，登录全国推免服务系统，注册和填写基本信息，完成网上报名、网上缴费、确认复试通知和待录取通知等环节。规定时间内未确认待录取通知者视为自动放弃拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.拟录取推免生应密切关注我校研究生招生信息网（网址：https://yz.bnu.edu.cn）、“京师研招”微信公众号，以及我院电话、邮件等通知，以便及时了解招生信息。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.获得拟录取资格的申请人，新生入学报到前未获得学士学位证书和本科毕业证书，将被取消录取或入学资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.体检将在新生入学报到后进行，体检不合格者取消入学资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.相关工作调整、更新及未尽事宜，将另行通知。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>六</span></strong></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/KAmVU9FEmibzAviaPJYV90DGNX6xgXFWfNiaibfTDy9PTzz1aZfGricNxCibib6DpwyD7tK3rWxcKya4Kfjw8lvQgVRYkEAw7LiafSPvYCIv2r0InT0/640?from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>咨询及申诉方式</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>（一）咨询</span></span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span><span>联系人：</span></span></strong><span><span>杨老师</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>电话：</span></span></strong><span><span>010-58802496</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>11312024077@bnu.edu.cn</span></span></p><p><span><strong><span><span>（二）申诉</span></span></strong></span></p><p><span><span>若对我院推免招生有异议，可以书面形式向我院进行申诉，联系方式如下：</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>11312024077@bnu.edu.cn</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>排版：吴华</span></span></p><p><span><span>责任编辑：石天煜</span></span></p><p><span><span>审定：袁治杰</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Tjx49ZIjSKJt5r2Njlq4x2GxYwPynHj15oEgcgleQjrkribBT8j61jQu3fuwW2WiaDTQqIPXMGtHPXK9OldJsPDg/640?from=appmsg#imgIndex=6\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Tjx49ZIjSKJt5r2Njlq4x2GxYwPynHj1FBVh0AO6wARyvrR5CRue3p6NJGskyxExXulYSFgksfeZhEuTkPOMOA/640?from=appmsg#imgIndex=7\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/Tjx49ZIjSKJu7S4CODuPJOw5h7QIzke5JX7SVQxRRicf6vGZZakShIClgNtD4R0ABuT3vIn8sMb597OtiamMJC2Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=8\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"8ed2875220b0c9adabd67d5f6c629827858dc66560e692d46f2c1cee2e740d62","textLength":1642,"sourceSha256":"f350719e7a962c35adee7dc3f31ffb78719e1f42fc5cb51054a22b4ce6d3ec75","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1eac1d2c6a354643880c","title":"2026年北京师范大学法学院2027年法律硕士（法学/非法学）专业学位研究生推荐免试综合考核实施细则","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:00.622543+00:00"}
